        "TileImage": "$($repository 42e7d00a-b477-4c4f-8b13-8cd4e7403e0d).Image",
        "Description": "47,\r\rYou have been tasked with a sensitive mission: the elimination of Cristina Dionisi, a prominent singer. Your client for this mission is Marco Abiatti.\r\rAbiatti has orchestrated this campaign specifically to eliminateDionisi due to her refusal to engage in a romantic encounter with him.\r\rHowever, it&apos;s crucial to note that Abiatti is adamant about achieving his goal, even if it means sacrificing part of his personnel to clear a path for the elimination of the target.\r\rGood Luck 47.",
